hrac', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d55a2d3-98d7-415d-8bfd-0aff736eee0f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Sigillo di Leshrac', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7c9cd2d4-6062-4ae3-9543-3b85f1800f47'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Símbolos Mágicos de Leshrac', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5358cbfb-aed5-432c-af82-4f8f89d9e57f'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Lhurgoyf', 'text': 'Die Stärke von Lhurgoyf ist gleich der Anzahl aller Kreaturen in allen Friedhöfen. Seine Widerstandskraft ist eins plus der Anzahl aller Kreaturen in allen Friedhöfen.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Lhurgoyf', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '966ff11b-4889-4481-89fb-6802c8ed2e19'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lhurgoyf', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d24d789-5de4-4306-bf8e-064fda61527d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lhurgoyf', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97bdbbfe-7784-4ee1-9a5b-a004e473fc5d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lhurgoyf', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f55624cb-67ec-4fbf-b35f-22f430c821f5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Lhurgoyf', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd66e3cb0-9beb-4d1a-89f2-abca0a229f36'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Lieder der Verdammten', 'text': 'Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um {B} in Höhe der Anzahl der Kreaturen in Deinem Friedhof.', 'type': 'Unterbrechungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6333e37-1758-44dc-8c46-a6335b8c3859'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Canciones de los malditos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67974f12-3329-4c9a-954a-5235fb32fd6d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Chants des damnés', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f33dce7e-78f4-4834-9f9e-7731b9d67ae4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Canti dei Dannati', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b0e26c5-6d60-4af7-a96d-61e2f5e468fd'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Canções dos Condenados', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '052a2e20-b60c-4f0d-bcba-ac14fac9635b'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Lim-Dûls Fluch', 'text': 'Lim-Dûls Fluch fügt während Deiner Versorgungsphase jeden Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nJeder Spieler kann {B} oder 3 bezahlen, um den Schaden an sich selbst zu verhindern.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5281ceae-689b-4245-961d-be7a5f3760c2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Brujería de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d40fd9d-7f2a-4f78-8149-fbedddfb86be'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Maléfice selon Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1dc9a48-73fa-4d5b-aaf1-3d5aa861727f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Maledizione di Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d0c7409-e37d-438f-9566-7b813291e64d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Bruxaria de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7284f9c-a8fc-4f15-b2f2-03b54265d1ae'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Lim-Dûls Kohorte', 'text': 'Kreaturen, die von Lim-Dûls Kohorte geblockt werden, können in diesem Zug nicht regenerieren.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Zombies', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e98b951-ee1d-4413-9c83-59bbf683f14b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cohorte de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20dff0a0-1adb-4cd0-8429-8bbb2151b165'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cohorte de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e43b3027-8a2d-48ba-ba4c-79bc08deb240'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Coorte di Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '019208c2-b987-4ac7-9b26-fc0912114398'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Coorte de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2dd739f-a60b-4ae4-937c-2001f74d3ce6'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Lim-Dûls Legionen', 'text': 'Tarnung im verschneiten Sumpf', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Zombies', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'afb54be7-a535-4edc-bd24-ce2168093e8b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Legiones de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '284a0484-cead-4e0a-8234-f748a542bd49'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Légions de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f0557be-bc37-4c6e-aa8b-2509234c79f6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Legioni di Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '496cdd87-5cd8-4415-829e-d9bf3b63ca98'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Legiões de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f8856f6-ee6c-497d-ad8c-6adf824097f0'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Lim-Dûls Schwur', 'text': 'Für jeden Schadenspunkt, der Dir zugefügt wird, oder für jeden Lebenspunkt, den Du verlierst, opfere eine bleibende Karte und lege eine Karte aus Deiner Hand ab. Du kannst auf diese Art nicht Lim-Dûls Schwur opfern. Ignoriere diesen Effekt, wenn Du keine bleibenden Karten außer Lim-Dûls Schwur beherrschst und keine Karten auf der Hand hast.\\n{B}{B}: Ziehe eine Karte.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fddaaf0-5cc4-4f31-9422-ffa99ce4dafa'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Juramento de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e2b88626-696e-452d-95a8-ea431e1fefe2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Serment de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fa9ba01-879b-4549-87dd-858fa1feefe2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Giuramento di Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da779169-f498-435b-b2e7-edb8c51ad266'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Juramento de Lim-Dûl', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30132bab-560b-416e-b0d8-10fb848c5234'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Lispelnder Geist', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nWenn der Lispelnde Geist als Angreifer deklariert wird, darf der verteidigende Spieler eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Geistes', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b2ca678-411b-4826-ba48-4714765249e6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Espíritu sibilante', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3dc8a819-22e2-4155-8b74-33fe45d29050'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Esprit stridulent', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b88a5875-bcc5-40c9-b329-7106aeee5008'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Spirito Sibilante', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '412920f9-ee68-48cb-8731-00a90295dde8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Espírito Sibilante', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '872a4335-7e16-4f34-bf1f-dba65f720f61'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Madenmassen', 'text': 'Kumulative Versorgung: 1\\nKann nicht von Nichtmauerkreaturen geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Insekten', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '896bea46-7862-482b-b4aa-8d44beb51469'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Plaga de larvas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'sc