n source. If a source deals damage to you more than once in a turn, you may pay o1 each time to prevent the damage.', 'o1: Prevent all damage against you from one red source. If a source deals damage to you more than once in a turn, you may pay o1 each time to prevent the damage.', 'o1: Prevent all damage against you from one white source. If a source deals damage to you more than once in a turn, you may pay o1 each time to prevent the damage.', 'o1o\\nG,oc\\nT: Counter target artifact ability requiring an activation cost. Play this ability as an interrupt.', "o1o\\nRo\\nG,oc\\nT: Remove from the game target creature, which doesn't have flying and is attacking you, and Giant Trap Door Spider.", 'o1o\\nRoo\\nR For the rest of the turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Mountain Titan whenever you successfully cast a black spell.', 'o1o\\nU,oc\\nT: Untap target artifact opponent controls and gain control of it until end of turn. If that artifact is an artifact creature, it can attack, and you may use any of its abilities that require oc\\nT as part of the activation cost. When you lose control of the artifact, tap it.', 'o1oo\\nG +1/+0 until end of turn', 'o1oo\\nR Flying and +2/+0. At end of turn, bury Goblin Ski Patrol. Use this ability only once and only if you control any snow-covered mountains.', 'o1oo\\nU Take target white or black creature from your graveyard and put it directly into play as though it were just summoned. That creature now requires an additional Cumulative Upkeep: o2. If the creature leaves play, remove it from the game.', 'o1oo\\nW Target green creature gains first strike until end of turn.', 'o2,oc\\nT: Attacking this turn does not cause target creature to tap. You cannot use this ability if defending player controls no snow-covered lands.', "o2,oc\\nT: Sacrifice Jester's Cap to look through target player's library and remove any three of those cards from the game. Reshuffle that library afterwards.", 'o2,oc\\nT: Sacrifice Pit Trap to bury target creature without flying that is attacking you.', "o2,oc\\nT: Target creature with power no greater than 3 gains flying until end of turn. Other effects may later be used to increase that creature's power beyond 3.", 'o2,oc\\nT: Target snow-covered land becomes a non-snow-covered land of the same type. Mark the changed land with a counter.\\no2,oc\\nT: Target non-snow-covered basic land becomes a snow-covered land of the same type. Mark the changed land with a counter.', 'o2: Discard a card at random from your hand to have Stormbind deal 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'o2: Prevent 1 damage to you.', 'o2: Sacrifice a land to put a +2/+2 counter on target creature. Use this ability only during upkeep.', 'o2: Sacrifice a snow-covered land to have all creatures deal no damage in combat this turn.', 'o2: Target creature gains banding until end of turn.', 'o2o\\nB,oc\\nT: Target player chooses and discards one card from his or her hand. Ignore this ability if that player has no cards in his or her hand. Use this ability only during your turn.', 'o2o\\nG,oc\\nT: Untap target creature.', "o2o\\nR,oc\\nT: Target creature you control gains a snow-covered landwalk ability of your choice until end of turn. At end of turn, return that creature to its owner's hand.", 'o2oo\\nR Target creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\no\\nUoo\\nU Target creature you control gains flying until end of turn. At end of turn, bury that creature.', 'o3,oc\\nT: Take the top card from your library and place it face up in front of you. You may play that card as though it were in your hand; if you do not play it by your next upkeep, remove it from the game.', 'o3,oc\\nT: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', 'o3,oc\\nT: Target creature gains trample until end of turn.', 'o3,oc\\nT: Target creature you control gets +3/+3 until end of turn. At end of turn, bury that creature.', "o3,oc\\nT: Target non-wall creature must attack. At end of turn, destroy that creature if it could not attack. Use this ability only during the creature's controller's turn before the attack. The creature's controller may counter this effect by paying X, where X is equal to the creature's casting cost. Arcum's Whistle does not affect creatures brought under their controller's control this turn.", "o3,oc\\nT: Target player names a card and then turns over the top card of his or her library. If that is the card named, put it into the player's hand. Otherwise, put it into the player's graveyard, and Vexing Arcanix deals 2 damage to that player.", "o3: Look at the top three cards of target player's library. Put them on the top of that player's library in any order.", 'o3: Untap target permanent.\\nUse this ability only when a black spell is successfully cast and only once for each black spell cast.', 'o3: Untap target permanent.\\nUse this ability only when a blue spell is successfully cast and only once for each blue spell cast.', 'o3: Untap target permanent.\\nUse this ability only when a green spell is successfully cast and only once for each green spell cast.', 'o3: Untap target permanent.\\nUse this ability only when a red spell is successfully cast and only once for each red spell cast.', 'o3: Untap target permanent.\\nUse this ability only when a white spell is successfully cast and only once for each white spell cast.', 'o3o\\nG,oc\\nT: Tap or untap target artifact, creature, or land.', 'o4,oc\\nT: Prevent all damage dealt to you from one source. Pentagram of the Ages does not prevent the same source damaging you again later this turn.', "o4,oc\\nT: Switch target enchantment from one creature to another; the enchantment's new target must be legal. The controller of the enchantment does not change. Treat the enchantment as though it were just cast on the new target.", "o\\nBoo\\nB When any opponent successfully casts a green spell, look at that player's hand and choose a card; he or she then discards that card. Use this ability only once each time a green spell is cast.\\no\\nBoo\\nB Return Leshrac's Sigil to owner's hand.", "o\\nGoo\\nG When any opponent successfully casts a black spell, draw a card. Use this ability only once each time a black spell is cast.\\no\\nGoo\\nG Return Freyalise's Charm to owner's hand.", 'o\\nR,oc\\nT: Take the top eight cards of your library; remove four of them at random from the game. Put the remaining four on top of your library in any order.', 'o\\nRo\\nR,oc\\nT: Target creature cannot regenerate this turn.\\no\\nRo\\nBo\\nB,oc\\nT: Regenerate target black or green creature.\\no\\nRo\\nGo\\nG,oc\\nT: Regenerate target black or green creature.', 'o\\nRo\\nR,oc\\nT: Target creature you control cannot be blocked this turn. At end of combat, destroy that creature and Goblin Sappers.\\no\\nRo\\nRo\\nRo\\nR,oc\\nT: Target creature you control cannot be blocked this turn. At end of combat, destroy that creature.', 'o\\nRoo\\nG +1/-1 until end of turn', 'o\\nU: +1/+0 until end of turn', "o\\nWoo\\nW Return target non-snow-covered land you control to owner's hand.", 'oc\\nT: Add either o\\nU or o\\nU and one colorless mana to your mana pool. This mana is usable only for cumulative upkeep. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oc\\nT: Add o1 to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool. Sulfurous Springs deals 1 damage to you.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool. Sulfurous Springs deals 1 damage to you.', 'oc\\nT: Add o1 to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool. Karplusan Forest deals 1 damage to you.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool. Karplusan Forest deals 1 damage to you.', 'oc\\nT: Add o1 to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool. Underground River deals 1 damage to you.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool. Underground River deals 1 damage to you.', 'oc\\nT: Add o1 to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool. Adarkar Wastes deals 1 damage to you.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool. Adarkar Wastes deals 1 damage to you.', 'oc\\nT: Add o1 to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool. Brushland deals 1 damage to you.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool. Brushland deals 1 damage to you.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nB to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nG to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nGo\\nG to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nR to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nU to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add o\\nW to your mana pool.', 'oc\\nT: Add two colorless mana to your mana pool. This mana may only be used to pay the activation cost of an artifact. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oc\\nT: Bury target permanent you own.', 'oc\\nT: Centaur Archer deals 1 damage to target creature with flying.', 'oc\\nT: Choose and discard a card from your hand to draw a card. If the card discarded was black, draw two cards instead of one; keep one and discard the other.', 'oc\\nT: Karplusan Yeti deals an amount of damage equal to its power to target creature. That creature deals an amount of damage equal to its power to Karplusan Yeti.', 'oc\\nT: Orcish Cannoneers deals 2 damage to target creature or player and 3 damage to you.', 'oc\\nT: Pay 1 life to counter target white spell. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oc\\nT: Pay 1 life to destroy target black spell. Effects that prevent or redirect damage cannot be used to counter this loss of life. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oc\\nT: Permanently change the text of target white enchantment you control that does not have cumulative upkeep by replacing all instances of one color word with another. For example, you may change "Counters black spells" to "Counters blue spells." Balduvian Shaman cannot change mana symbols. That enchantment now has Cumulative Upkeep: o1.', 'oc\\nT: Prevent 1 damage to any non-green creature or any player or up to 2 damage to any green creature.', 'oc\\nT: Redirect to Kjeldoran Royal Guard all damage dealt to you from unblocked creatures this turn.', 'oc\\nT: Sacrifice Gangrenous Zombies to have it deal 1 damage to each creature and player. If you control any snow-covered swamps, Gangrenous Zombies instead deals 2 damage to each creature and player.', "oc\\nT: Sacrifice Urza's Bauble to choose a card at random from target player's hand; look at that card. Ignore this ability if that player has no cards left in hand. Draw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'oc\\nT: Sacrifice a creature to give target creature +2/+2 until end of turn.\\no1o\\nUo\\nU: Sacrifice a creature to counter target summon spell.', 'oc\\nT: Sacrifice a forest to add three mana in any combination of red and/or green to your mana pool. Play this ability as an interrupt.', "oc\\nT: Sacrifice a red or white creature to have Freyalise Supplicant deal an amount of damage equal to half the creature's power, rounded down, to target creature or player.", 'oc\\nT: Switch the blocking creatures of two target attacking creatures; all defense must remain legal. Use this ability only during combat after defense is chosen and before damage is dealt.', 'oc\\nT: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. If that creature leaves play this turn, bury Kjeldoran Guard. Use this ability only when attack or defense is announced and only if defending player controls no snow-covered lands.', 'oc\\nT: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. If that creature leaves play this turn, bury Kjeldoran Elite Guard. Use this ability only when attack or defense is announced.', "oc\\nT: Target land becomes a swamp until its controller's next untap phase.", 'oc\\nT: Target snow-covered land becomes a 2/2 creature until end of turn. The target still counts as land but cannot be tapped for mana if it came into play on a side this turn.', "oc\\nT: Untap target blue creature.\\noc\\nT: Force target non-wall creature to attack. If creature cannot attack, destroy it at end of turn. Use this ability only during target creature's controller's turn, before the attack. Cannot target creatures brought under their controller's control this turn.", 'oc\\nT: Untap target land. Play this ability as an interrupt.', 'oc\\nT: Zuran Spellcaster deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'oo\\nB +1/+1 until end of turn', 'oo\\nB Any creature damaged by Bone Shaman this turn cannot regenerate until end of turn.', 'oo\\nG Regenerate', 'oo\\nR +1/+0 until end of turn', 'oo\\nR +1/+1 until end of turn', 'oo\\nR +2/+0 until end of turn. Use this ability only when a creature is assigned to block Grizzled Wolverine and only once each turn.', 'oo\\nU Counter target spell that targets Mistfolk.', 'oo\\nW Sacrifice an enchantment to destroy target enchantment.\\no3o\\nUoo\\nU Counter target enchantment.']
